#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:7
msgid "Layout 1.2 → 1.3 Upgrade"
msgstr "Layout 1.2 → 1.3 Actualización"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:9
msgid ""
"The HVM 1.3 layout replaces the Pacemaker-based high availability stack with"
" the |morpheus| agent's QuorumCheckService. Clusters running layout 1.2 can "
"be upgraded to 1.3."
msgstr ""
"El HVM 1.3 layout replaces el Pacemaker-based alta disponibilidad stack con "
"el |morpheus| agent's QuorumCheckService. Clústeres ejecutando layout 1.2 "
"puede be upgraded a 1.3."

