#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:51
msgid ""
"The layout upgrade is performed as part of a cluster update operation. "
"During the upgrade:"
msgstr ""
"El layout actualización es performed como part de un cluster update "
"operación. Durante el actualización:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:53
msgid "Pacemaker services are disabled and removed"
msgstr "Pacemaker servicios están deshabilitados y eliminado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:54
msgid "The |morpheus| agent's QuorumCheckService activates"
msgstr "El |morpheus| agent's QuorumCheckService activates"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:55
