"Only one cluster update operation can run at a time. Attempting to start a "
"second update while one is in progress will be rejected."
msgstr ""
"Solo one cluster update operación puede ejecutar en un tiempo. Attempting a "
"iniciar un second update mientras one es en progress será be rejected."

