#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:123
msgid "Pre-Upgrade Considerations"
msgstr "Pre-Actualización Considerations"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:125
msgid ""
"Active HVM clusters will continue to operate during the appliance upgrade "
"(agents are self-sustaining)"
msgstr ""
"Activo HVM clusters será continuar a operate durante el appliance "
"actualización (agents son self-sustaining)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:126
msgid "Quorum decisions are made by agents independently of the appliance"
msgstr "Quorum decisions son made por agents independently del appliance"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:127
msgid "Heartbeat writes continue regardless of appliance connectivity"
msgstr "Heartbeat writes continuar regardless de appliance connectivity"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:128
msgid "VM failover will still work during appliance downtime"
msgstr ""
"VM conmutación por error será todavía funcionar durante appliance downtime"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:130
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| agent's QuorumCheckService operates autonomously. Cluster "
"quorum, heartbeat monitoring, and failover continue even if the |morpheus| "
"appliance is offline for maintenance."
msgstr ""
"El |morpheus| agent's QuorumCheckService operates autonomously. Clúster "
"quorum, heartbeat monitoring, y conmutación por error continuar incluso si "
"el |morpheus| appliance es offline para mantenimiento."

