#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:148
msgid "Automatic Agent Upgrades"
msgstr "Automático Agent Upgrades"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/upgrading.rst:150
msgid ""
"During rolling cluster updates, if a host's agent version is below the "
"``minAgentVersion`` required by the update definition, the agent is upgraded"
